  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CORE FUNDING TO MISEAN CARA, WHICH PROVIDES GRANTS TO MISSIONARY ORGANISATIONS FOR THEIR DEVELOPMENT WORK IN AFRICA, ASIA AND SOUTH AMERICA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PARTNER: Mill Hill Missionaries PROJECT: The Kitale Community Empowerment project in Kenya seeks to mitigate the effects of poor health outcomes and societal breakdown particularly among persons from resource constrained backgrounds.   The project addresses the underlying systemic factors that drive brokenness, conflicts, HIV/AIDS prevalence, alcohol/substance abuse, environmental decay &amp; poverty.  It also ensures enhanced access to social justice (human rights, equitable access to resources and opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
